                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "These topics were used for interviews to gain a deeper understanding of the factors perceived by nurses to impede or promote their support of patients’ self-management within the dynamic environment of the in-patient hospital setting. The topics involve\n1) perspectives on providing self-management support, 2) factors influencing self-management support, and 3) elaboration of the questionnaire survey outcomes."
